### 🟡 Dead Code

**DC1 — 3 unused `AppTheme.CaloriePill` tokens**  
ThemeCaloriePill.swift: `pillCornerRadius`, `pillVerticalPadding`, `textSetupPrompt` — defined, zero call sites. `Capsule()` ignores explicit corner radius; vertical padding never applied; `textSetupPrompt` color never used.

**DC2 — 4 dead `Strings.CaloriePill` constants**  
Strings+CaloriePill.swift: `rowActive`, `rowBasal`, `sectionActivity`, `rowTotalTDEE` — defined for the activity section that was never implemented in the sheet.

**DC3 — Unreachable `pillLabel` branch**  
CaloriePillView.swift: `else { Strings.CaloriePill.setupProfile }` — unreachable because `isVisible == false` when `consumed == 0 && tdee == nil`, so `if self.data.isVisible { ... }` already gates it out.

